# mtplx-131k-vs-unleashed-speedwatch
owner: mtplx-speedwatch · cadence: every 2h · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a repeatable 65K/131K speedwatch that only compares MTPLX vs Unleashed + DFlash2 on this exact setup?**

## Prompt
Run a fixed prompt-shape benchmark on port 11613 and 11606: short 500 tokens/200 completion, medium 5K tokens/100 completion, long 1000 tokens/500 completion. Record tok/s, end-to-end tok/s, finish_reason, prompt_tokens, active/cache/projected bytes if exposed. Only report; do not change config.

## Evidence
> Run speed tests: short prompt 500 tokens, medium 5K prompt 100 tokens, long generation 1000 tokens
> Both at 131K context with q8 KV cache
